{"id":"36e73d05a266e3c0","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-minimal-pair.md","title":"极小对","display":"df-minimal-pair — 极小对","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-minimal-pair","aliases":["20-df-minimal-pair"],"display":"df-minimal-pair — 极小对","chapter":"6","section":"6.2","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definition 6.2.1","source_pdf_pages":[168],"source_printed_pages":[134],"depends_on":["[[20-df-degle]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-minimal-pair"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-minimal-pair</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-minimal-pair — 极小对"},{"key":"chapter","html":"6"},{"key":"section","html":"6.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 6.2.1"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>168</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>134</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e888141c21b61ce5\" href=\"?note=e888141c21b61ce5\" title=\"20-df-degle\">20-df-degle</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e888141c21b61ce5\" href=\"?note=e888141c21b61ce5\" title=\"20-df-degle\">20-df-degle</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}pair}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{MinimalPair}(\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b&gt;\\mathbf0\\land\\forall\\mathbf c\\in\\mathcal D\\\n[(\\mathbf c\\le\\mathbf a\\land\\mathbf c\\le\\mathbf b)\\Rightarrow\\mathbf c=\\mathbf0].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}pair}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{MinimalPair}(\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b&gt;\\mathbf0\\land\\forall\\mathbf c\\in\\mathcal D\\\n[(\\mathbf c\\le\\mathbf a\\land\\mathbf c\\le\\mathbf b)\\Rightarrow\\mathbf c=\\mathbf0].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>两个非零度的共同下度只有零度。与单个极小度不同；两边均不必是极小度。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 6.2.1；印刷页 134；PDF 第 168 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-degle","status":"resolved","id":"e888141c21b61ce5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-degle]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-degle","status":"resolved","id":"e888141c21b61ce5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-degle]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}pair}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{MinimalPair}(\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b>\\mathbf0\\land\\forall\\mathbf c\\in\\mathcal D\\\n[(\\mathbf c\\le\\mathbf a\\land\\mathbf c\\le\\mathbf b)\\Rightarrow\\mathbf c=\\mathbf0].","display":true}],"bytes":1024,"backlinks":[{"id":"1ae4456a459d7663","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-redeg]]；see [[20-df-